<figure id="{{ id }}" class="{{ category }}"><div class="figure-label"><span>{{ version }}</span><span class="value">{{ value }}</span></div><div class="capture-frame"><img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ data }}" alt="{{ alt }}" loading="lazy"><span class="tooltip-outline" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><figcaption><strong>{{ description }}</strong>Same later consumer, after the controlled second pass.<p class="annotation-line">① Actual hovered tooltip: {{ tooltip }}.</p><button type="button" class="inspect js-only" data-capture="{{ id }}">Inspect full-resolution capture</button><details class="capture-provenance"><summary>Producing source and traceability</summary><a href="#impact-visual-fixture">Fixture</a> · <a href="#capture-producing-puppet-source">Final puppet</a>; exact public permalink unavailable.</details></figcaption></figure>